BanditRL.OnlineLearning.empiricalMean_succ (y : ℕ → ℝ) (t : ℕ) :
  BanditRL.OnlineLearning.empiricalMean y (t + 1) =
    BanditRL.OnlineLearning.empiricalMean y t + (y t - BanditRL.OnlineLearning.empiricalMean y t) / (↑t + 1)
'BanditRL.OnlineLearning.empiricalMean_succ' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
